## Technical Notes

### OSC Commands
- `/s_new` - Create new synth node
- `/n_free` - Free synth node
- `/n_set` - Set node controls
- `/s_dumpTree` - Query server state

### Node Architecture
- **Server:** scsynth (audio synthesis server)
- **Language:** sclang (programming language)
- **Nodes:** Synth instances in server tree
- **Groups:** Node organization containers

### Timing
- Sample-accurate timing
- Real-time audio processing
- Low-latency control (< 1ms)

## Common Workflows

### Live Performance
```
# Create synth and control in real-time
supercollider_manager("create_synth", def_name="fm_pad", node_id=2000)
supercollider_manager("set_control", node_id=2000, control_name="freq", value=220.0)
supercollider_manager("set_control", node_id=2000, control_name="mod_ratio", value=2.0)
```

### Generative Systems
```
# Automated composition
for note in melody:
    supercollider_manager("set_control", node_id=1000, control_name="freq", value=note_freq)
    time.sleep(note_duration)
```

